# case-scaleup-1111 brain pool (owner 2026-11-11 01:05, plan/eval2/case-scaleup-1111/BRIEF.md): next sizes of the 13 case studies, Offline only (exports and merge joins), tier cinf (no time limit), mem 250; generated by scripts/case-scaleup-1111/{load,gen,emit}.py. 1 groups, 8 rows, estimated 20.6 h of work (extrapolated, planning only, R10); groups in descending order of their largest row; within a group exports before their joins; a group goes to one host (its joins read the exports from that node's $EVAL_OUT).
# heaps as in scaleup-1110 (volta -Xmx16g, brain -Xmx12g, pinky -Xmx8g); at most one JMC export at a time on a pinky or a volta, three on a brain; the heap changes memory only, not the explored graphs
